<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About & Architecture — Personal Code Editor</title>
    <meta name="description"
        content="Personal Code Editor — Cloud & Local AI IDE with Monaco Editor, containerized Bubblewrap & cgroup v2 sandbox execution, and LangChain pair programming.">

    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Remix Icons -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.5.0/fonts/remixicon.css" rel="stylesheet" />

    <!-- Tailwind CDN for utility classes -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        void: '#000000',
                        surface: '#0A0A0A',
                        'surface-elevated': '#111111',
                        edge: '#1E1E1E',
                        blue: '#2563EB',
                        'blue-hover': '#1D4ED8',
                        snow: '#FFFFFF',
                        muted: '#6B7280',
                        danger: '#EF4444',
                        ok: '#22C55E'
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['"Space Grotesk"', 'system-ui', 'sans-serif'],
                        mono: ['"JetBrains Mono"', 'ui-monospace', 'monospace']
                    },
                    fontSize: {
                        '2xs': ['0.6875rem', { lineHeight: '1rem' }],
                        '3xs': ['0.625rem', { lineHeight: '0.875rem' }],
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <style>
        :root {
            --void: #000000;
            --surface: #0a0a0a;
            --surface-elevated: #111111;
            --edge: #1e1e1e;
            --edge-focus: #2563eb;
            --blue: #2563eb;
            --blue-hover: #1d4ed8;
            --snow: #ffffff;
            --muted: #6b7280;
            --danger: #ef4444;
            --danger-hover: #dc2626;
            --ok: #22c55e;
        }

        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        html,
        body {
            background-color: var(--void);
            color: var(--snow);
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        /* Top Header */
        .dashboard-header {
            height: 52px;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--edge);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 24px;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 40;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .header-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--blue);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
        }

        .header-brand:hover {
            opacity: 0.85;
        }

        .header-nav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .header-nav a {
            color: var(--muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.15s ease;
        }

        .header-nav a:hover {
            color: var(--snow);
        }

        .header-controls {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .btn-launch-editor {
            background-color: var(--blue);
            color: var(--snow);
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
        }

        .btn-launch-editor:hover {
            background-color: var(--blue-hover);
        }

        .header-divider {
            width: 1px;
            height: 16px;
            background-color: var(--edge);
        }

        .user-tag {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .user-tag-label {
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .user-tag-name {
            color: var(--snow);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .btn-header-exit {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
            transition: color 0.15s ease;
            margin-left: 4px;
        }

        .btn-header-exit:hover {
            color: var(--snow);
        }

        /* Main Container */
        .dashboard-main {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 1280px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 32px 24px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 32px;
        }

        /* Welcome Card */
        .welcome-card {
            background-color: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--edge);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 24px 28px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .welcome-title {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
            color: var(--snow);
        }

        .welcome-subtitle {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-top: 6px;
            max-width: 720px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .welcome-actions {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .btn-action-primary {
            background-color: var(--blue);
            color: var(--snow);
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 7px 14px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
        }

        .btn-action-primary:hover {
            background-color: var(--blue-hover);
        }

        .btn-action-secondary {
            background-color: var(--void);
            color: var(--snow);
            border: 1px solid var(--edge);
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            padding: 7px 14px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            transition: border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
        }

        .btn-action-secondary:hover {
            border-color: var(--muted);
        }

        /* Section Headers */
        .section-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--edge);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .section-title-wrap {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--snow);
        }

        .section-count {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .section-quick-link {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--blue);
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
        }

        .section-quick-link:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* Cards and Panels */
        .item-card {
            background-color: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--edge);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 18px 20px;
            transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
        }

        .item-card:hover {
            border-color: #2e2e2e;
        }

        .interactive-tab-btn {
            background-color: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--edge);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--muted);
            text-align: left;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            transition: all 0.15s ease;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .interactive-tab-btn:hover {
            color: var(--snow);
            border-color: var(--muted);
        }

        .interactive-tab-btn.active {
            border-color: var(--blue);
            background-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
            color: var(--snow);
        }

        .interactive-pane {
            background-color: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--edge);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 24px;
            min-height: 380px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .dashboard-footer {
            height: 48px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--edge);
            padding: 0 24px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 11.5px;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-top: auto;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: var(--void);
        }

        .footer-links {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .footer-link {
            color: var(--muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.15s ease;
        }

        .footer-link:hover {
            color: var(--snow);
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #000000;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #1e1e1e;
            border-radius: 3px;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: #2563eb;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- ─── Top Header ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <header class="dashboard-header">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px;">
            <a href="/aboutCodeEditor" class="header-brand">
                <i class="ri-code-box-line"></i>
                <span>pce/about</span>
            </a>
            <div class="header-divider hidden md:block"></div>
            <nav class="header-nav hidden md:flex">
                <a href="#features">features</a>
                <a href="#architecture">architecture</a>
                <a href="#sandbox">sandbox</a>
                <a href="#ai">ai agent</a>
                <a href="#security">security</a>
            </nav>
        </div>

        <div class="header-controls">
            <a href="/editor" class="btn-launch-editor">
                <i class="ri-code-s-slash-line"></i>
                <span>Launch Editor</span>
            </a>
            <% if (typeof user !== "undefined" && user) { %>
                <div class="header-divider"></div>
                <div class="user-tag">
                    <span class="user-tag-label"><i class="ri-user-3-line"></i> user:</span>
                    <span class="user-tag-name"><%= user.username %></span>
                </div>
                <a href="/DashboardCodeEditor" class="btn-header-exit" title="Go to Dashboard">
                    <i class="ri-dashboard-line"></i>
                    <span>dashboard</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/logout" class="btn-header-exit" title="Sign Out">
                    <i class="ri-logout-box-r-line"></i>
                    <span>exit</span>
                </a>
            <% } else { %>
                <div class="header-divider"></div>
                <a href="/DashboardCodeEditor" class="btn-header-exit" title="Dashboard">
                    <i class="ri-dashboard-line"></i>
                    <span>dashboard</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/login" class="btn-header-exit" title="Sign In">
                    <i class="ri-login-box-line"></i>
                    <span>login</span>
                </a>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ─── Main Container ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <main class="dashboard-main">

        <!-- Welcome / Hero Card -->
        <section class="welcome-card">
            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 font-mono text-2xs">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ok">
                        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-ok animate-pulse"></span>
                        Codebox Sandbox Active
                    </span>
                    <span class="text-edge">&bull;</span>
                    <span class="text-muted">cgroup v2 delegated &bull; bwrap 0.12.0 &bull; LangChain pair programmer</span>
                </div>
                <h1 class="welcome-title">Personal Code Editor — Architecture & Systems</h1>
                <p class="welcome-subtitle">
                    A cloud-native web IDE pairing the Monaco Editor engine with an isolated cgroup v2 & Bubblewrap sandbox execution engine, real-time LangChain streaming AI assistance, and zero-trust security boundaries.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="welcome-actions">
                <a href="/editor" class="btn-action-primary">
                    <i class="ri-play-line"></i>
                    <span>Launch Editor</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/DashboardCodeEditor" class="btn-action-secondary">
                    <i class="ri-dashboard-line"></i>
                    <span>Workspaces</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://github.com/niteshxedev-byte/codeEditor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-action-secondary">
                    <i class="ri-github-line"></i>
                    <span>GitHub</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ─── Core Capabilities Grid ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
        <section id="features">
            <div class="section-header">
                <div class="section-title-wrap">
                    <i class="ri-terminal-box-line text-blue"></i>
                    <span>Core Capabilities</span>
                    <span class="section-count">(6 runtimes &bull; Monaco Engine &bull; AI Pair Agent)</span>
                </div>
                <a href="/editor" class="section-quick-link">
                    <span>+ open editor</span>
                    <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3.5">
                
                <div class="item-card space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-snow font-medium flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="ri-code-s-slash-line text-blue"></i>
                            <span>Monaco Editor Core</span>
                        </span>
                        <span class="font-mono text-2xs text-muted">VS Code core</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed font-sans">
                        Full-featured code editing experience with multi-language syntax highlighting, virtual tab buffer management, keyboard bindings, and debounced auto-save to browser local storage.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="item-card space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-snow font-medium flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="ri-shield-check-line text-blue"></i>
                            <span>Codebox Container Sandbox</span>
                        </span>
                        <span class="font-mono text-2xs text-ok">cgroup v2</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed font-sans">
                        Runs JavaScript, Python, C++, C, Java, Rust, and Bash inside hardened Bubblewrap namespaces governed by Linux cgroup v2 subtree aggregate controls and Seccomp-BPF filters.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="item-card space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-snow font-medium flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="ri-robot-2-line text-blue"></i>
                            <span>LangChain AI Agent</span>
                        </span>
                        <span class="font-mono text-2xs text-muted">Ollama & Cloud</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed font-sans">
                        Real-time AI pair programmer streaming token chunks, chain-of-thought reasoning, and autonomous workspace tools (create, inspect, update files) over authenticated Socket.IO channels.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="item-card space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-snow font-medium flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="ri-window-line text-blue"></i>
                            <span>Live HTML Sandbox Preview</span>
                        </span>
                        <span class="font-mono text-2xs text-muted">Opaque CSP</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed font-sans">
                        Renders full client-side HTML, CSS, and JavaScript components in an isolated sandboxed iframe with strict Content-Security-Policy that strips access to application cookies and credentials.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="item-card space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-snow font-medium flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="ri-folder-zip-line text-blue"></i>
                            <span>Workspace Archiving & PDF</span>
                        </span>
                        <span class="font-mono text-2xs text-muted">MongoDB Atlas</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed font-sans">
                        Manage multiple virtual code projects, import/export full workspace archives as ZIP files, and generate formatted PDF code documentation with syntax highlighting directly from the editor toolbar.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="item-card space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-snow font-medium flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="ri-lock-2-line text-blue"></i>
                            <span>Zero-Trust Security Matrix</span>
                        </span>
                        <span class="font-mono text-2xs text-muted">Rate Limited</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed font-sans">
                        Guarded with httpOnly JWT cookies, bcrypt password hashing (12 rounds), sliding-window rate limiters across all API and WebSocket entrypoints, and strict PUBLIC_URL origin lockdown.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ─── Interactive Architecture Inspector ──────────────────────────── -->
        <section id="architecture">
            <div class="section-header">
                <div class="section-title-wrap">
                    <i class="ri-cpu-line text-blue"></i>
                    <span>System Architecture</span>
                    <span class="section-count">(Interactive Component Inspector)</span>
                </div>
                <span class="font-mono text-2xs text-muted">Click any layer to inspect</span>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start">
                
                <!-- Left Tabs Menu -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-2">
                    <button type="button" class="interactive-tab-btn active" data-target="tab-editor">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                            <i class="ri-terminal-window-line text-blue"></i>
                            <span>Client Workspace (Monaco + SPA)</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-2xs text-muted">Browser</span>
                    </button>

                    <button type="button" class="interactive-tab-btn" data-target="tab-gateway">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                            <i class="ri-server-line text-muted"></i>
                            <span>Express.js API & Gateway Core</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-2xs text-muted">Backend</span>
                    </button>

                    <button type="button" class="interactive-tab-btn" data-target="tab-ratelimit">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                            <i class="ri-shield-line text-muted"></i>
                            <span>Sliding-Window Rate Limiter</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-2xs text-muted">Guard</span>
                    </button>

                    <button type="button" class="interactive-tab-btn" data-target="tab-sandbox">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                            <i class="ri-box-3-line text-muted"></i>
                            <span>Codebox Execution Sandbox</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-2xs text-muted">Compute</span>
                    </button>

                    <button type="button" class="interactive-tab-btn" data-target="tab-ai">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                            <i class="ri-sparkling-2-line text-muted"></i>
                            <span>LangChain AI Agent (Ollama)</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-2xs text-muted">Inference</span>
                    </button>

                    <button type="button" class="interactive-tab-btn" data-target="tab-database">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                            <i class="ri-database-2-line text-muted"></i>
                            <span>MongoDB Atlas & File Storage</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-2xs text-muted">Storage</span>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Right Detail Pane -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 interactive-pane">
                    
                    <!-- 1. Monaco Editor -->
                    <div id="pane-tab-editor" class="arch-content space-y-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-edge">
                            <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-medium text-snow">Client Workspace (Monaco Editor Engine)</h3>
                            <span class="font-mono text-2xs text-blue bg-blue/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-blue/20">Frontend Layer</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed font-sans">
                            Powers the code editor using VS Code's core editor engine. Handles multi-model buffer switching, real-time syntax coloring, interactive execution terminal with tabbed stdout/stderr, virtual file system tree, and debounced auto-save into localStorage.
                        </p>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 font-mono text-xs pt-1">
                            <div class="bg-void p-3 rounded border border-edge">
                                <span class="text-2xs text-muted block mb-1">SYNTAX ENGINE</span>
                                <span class="text-snow">Monaco Language Models</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-void p-3 rounded border border-edge">
                                <span class="text-2xs text-muted block mb-1">LOCAL PERSISTENCE</span>
                                <span class="text-snow">Debounced localStorage (350ms)</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="font-mono text-2xs bg-void p-3 rounded border border-edge text-muted overflow-x-auto">
                            <span class="text-snow">Supported Editor Mappings:</span> JS (63), Python (71), C++ (54), C (50), Java (62), Rust (73), Bash (46)
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 2. Express Gateway -->
                    <div id="pane-tab-gateway" class="arch-content hidden space-y-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-edge">
                            <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-medium text-snow">Express.js API & Gateway Core</h3>
                            <span class="font-mono text-2xs text-blue bg-blue/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-blue/20">Application Backend</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed font-sans">
                            Central application server built with Node.js and Express 5. Verifies HMAC-SHA256 JWT cookies, routes project management requests, handles multipart zip and PDF file uploads, and proxies authenticated execution requests to Codebox with Bearer headers.
                        </p>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 font-mono text-xs pt-1">
                            <div class="bg-void p-3 rounded border border-edge">
